## graph_node_id {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "description": "移動・再分類・GitHub同期後も変化しない論理identity。file_pathはこのIDを参照する可変projectionでありidentityに使わない"}
## artifact_kind {"type": "string", "enum": ["issue", "task", "specification", "architecture", "feature", "document"], "description": "成果物種別。正規rootへ issue→issues/task→tasks/specification→specs/architecture→architecture/feature→features/document→docs と決定論写像する。feature はマクロ層の機能単位ノード (purpose/goal/scope_in/scope_out/acceptance/architecture_refs を第一級に保持、MM-01)"}
## artifact_subtypes {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["frontend", "backend", "infrastructure", "data", "security", "api"]}, "uniqueItems": true, "description": "architecture subtype または specification の conditional template。architecture は1種以上、非該当kindは空配列を許す"}
## project_id {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "description": "横断分類用project identifier。物理top-levelを決めず、閾値超過時だけsecondary partitionに使う"}
## domain {"type": "string", "minLength": 1, "description": "横断分類用domain。1 leafが200件を超えた場合の第一partition key"}
## status {"type": "string", "enum": ["draft", "active", "blocked", "done", "closed", "tombstoned"], "description": "全artifact共通workflow state。GitHub Issue openはactive、closeはclosedへ写像し、delete相当はtombstonedで物理削除しない"}
## priority {"type": ["string", "null"], "description": "tracker/Projectsへ投影可能なrepo-local priority。nullは未設定"}
## file_path {"type": "string", "pattern": "^(issues|tasks|specs|architecture|features|docs)/.+\\.md$", "description": "全artifactが持つ正規root配下の人間可読Markdownへの参照。graph_node_idは不変、file_pathはrouting policyとpartition状態から再計算可能な派生値。feature は features/ 配下 (MM-02)"}
## template_id {"type": "string", "enum": ["issue", "task", "document", "specification", "architecture", "feature"], "description": "artifact_kindから自動選択した基底テンプレート"}
## template_version {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+$", "description": "生成時に使用したテンプレート契約版。正本更新時は既存文書を全書換せずmigration previewへ使う"}
## confirmation_status {"type": "string", "enum": ["draft", "confirmed", "superseded"], "description": "内容確定状態。system plan入力はspecification/architectureがconfirmedであることを要求する"}
## evaluation_status {"type": "string", "enum": ["pending", "pass", "fail", "stale"], "description": "独立評価状態。C14/C15/C04はpass以外をIssue起票・推薦・実装handoff対象にしない"}
## confirmation_evidence {"type": "object", "required": ["evaluator", "evidence_ref", "evaluated_digest"], "properties": {"evaluator": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "evidence_ref": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "evaluated_digest": {"type": ["string", "null"], "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{64}$"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "description": "confirmation/evaluationを同一artifact digestへpinしstale PASSを拒否する"}
## tracker_binding {"type": "string", "enum": ["beads", "github", "none", "repo-config-default"], "description": "issue_linkageと対称のtracker択一宣言。beads=bd issueとして実行管理、github=GitHub Issueとして実行管理、none=どちらにも投影しない。repo-config-default=登録搬送時のみの遅延束縛sentinel (dev-graph-registration payloadが搬送し、C02がatomic登録時に.dev-graph/config.jsonのexecution_trackerから解決する。永続ノードには現れてはならず、残存はC11がfail-closed検査する)。単一publication authority (references/execution-tracker-contract.md §4) の起点で、github_publication.modeとの排他はallOfでfail-closed検査する"}
## resource_scope {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^(?!/)(?!.*(?:^|/)\\.\\.(?:/|$)).+$"}, "description": "touches: このノードが触るファイル/ディレクトリパス配列。既定はディレクトリ単位、ノードがファイル単位を明示した場合はファイル単位を優先し、双方混在時は広い方(ディレクトリ単位)へフォールバックする。並列バッチのresource_scope重複回避(要件C10)の土台"}
## architecture_refs {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1}, "uniqueItems": true, "description": "feature ノードが参照する architecture ノードの graph_node_id 配列。artifact_kind=feature のとき1件以上必須、他kindは空配列 (MM-01)。system-spec-harness由来のarchitectureはlineage参照のみで複製しない (MM-12)"}
## implementation_readiness {"type": "object", "required": ["status", "missing_sections", "checked_at"], "properties": {"status": {"type": "string", "enum": ["complete", "incomplete", "not_applicable"]}, "missing_sections": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "uniqueItems": true}, "checked_at": {"type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "description": "template-contract.jsonの必須field/section、placeholder、conditional template、参照解決を検査した実装着手準備状態"}
## classification_confidence {"type": "number", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1, "description": "artifact_kind/domain/project_id自動分類のconfidence。0.80以上かつ第2候補との差0.15以上で自動確定、それ未満はpreview後に確認"}
